  "findings": [
    "Critical: original deny-all CNP ingress:[{}] allowed all ingress. Replaced with explicit namespaced Kubernetes NetworkPolicy policyTypes both directions and ingress:[], DNS-only egress; isolated from the L7 allow lab.",
    "Fixed resolver label, TCP+UDP DNS and DNS proxy observation for optional toFQDNs dependency policy. Database/API placeholders are explicitly unprovided, not a runnable production backend.",
    "Replaced duplicate/mismatched CNPs, Korean missing apiVersion, and TLS8443 HTTP rule with matched plaintext HTTP demo on8080; GETroot permitted, POST denied, separate unauthorizedclient.",
    "Valued HTTP Headers matching is literal, not regex/JWT validation; header presence/format does not authenticate. Current KafkaL7 removal and HTTP Envoy versus DNS proxy distinction reflected.",
    "Removed fictional threat/anomaly/Slack/flowlog ConfigMap configuration. Hubble supplies network observations, Tetragon supplies separately configured runtime security, external detection/response/WAF integration is required.",
    "Separated security identities, SPIRE out-of-band mutual authentication Beta, separate ztunnel workloadmTLS Beta, and IPsec/WireGuard transport encryption; ClusterMesh/auth interoperability and encryption coverage limits explicit.",
    "Alternative versioned Helm encryption fragments replace simultaneous raw encryption toggles; IPsec Secret/key management prerequisites, WireGuard51871/kernel, same-node/external/control-plane boundaries documented.",
    "Hubble data path uses datapath/proxy/agent events and bounded memory; Relay is not durable storage. Real static exporter fields/rotation/minimal metadata mask plus external collector/retention requirements.",
    "Fixed nonexistent public9091 metrics target: headlesshubble-metrics9965, Service labelk8s-app:hubble and Podselectork8s-app:cilium, per-endpoint discovery and actual ServiceMonitor label/namespace selection.",
    "Corrected metric plugin semantics: TCPflags not arbitraryRTT/retrans/connectioncounts; DNScounts not latencyhist; httpV2 response-derived status/count/duration and no simultaneous oldhttp.",
    "CLI corrected to hubble status, namespaced/directional Pod filters, DROPPED verdict plus POLICY_DENIED reason, 4+/5+ HTTP status filters and jsonpb envelope. Removed fakewebhook-forwarder and uncontrolled latestAMD64downloads.",
    "Finite actual-jq summary distinguishes flow/non-flow/missingreason records and counts observations rather than unique attacks or lossless packets. No external notifications sent.",
    "All40MCQs aligned to prose with one correctanswer; currentAPI, defaultdeny, auth/encryption, UIrole and metrics/ServiceMonitor prerequisites corrected."
  ],
